            <h1>About SkillLinkX</h1>
            <p>SkillLinkX is a next-generation professional career and hiring ecosystem built to bridge the gap between ambitious students, job seekers, and forward-thinking companies.</p>

            <h2>Our Mission</h2>
            <p>We believe finding the right career opportunity should be transparent, accessible, and merit-driven. SkillLinkX empowers talent with modern career readiness tools while providing employers with verified, skilled candidates.</p>

            <h2>What We Offer</h2>
            <p>From seamless job and internship discovery to built-in ATS resume assistance and company management dashboards, SkillLinkX provides end-to-end tooling for modern workforce growth.</p>
